{"productId": "8fc41a7c-b78b-468e-8e7a-e7af4233545e", "modelName": "X-Celsior", "modelDescription": "Step into the future of hunting with the ATN X-Celsior Night Vision Scope, the ultimate tool for the modern hunter who demands precision, clarity, and reliability. Engineered with an Ultra Sensitive Night Time Sensor boasting a crystal-clear 2688x1944 pixel resolution, this scope ensures unmatched performance in low-light and pitch-black conditions, allowing you to spot your target even in the darkest environments. The X-Celsior's 1280 High Definition Display brings every detail into sharp focus, while the Stadiametric Rangefinder and ATN Predator Reticle deliver pinpoint accuracy, helping you make every shot count. Designed with hunters in mind, this scope features a powerful long-range IR illuminator for enhanced visibility and is crafted to be lightweight and durable for rugged field use. With a long-lasting internal lithium-ion battery, the X-Celsior Scope keeps you on the hunt for over 10 hours, so you can stay in the field longer without interruptions. Whether you're stalking prey at dusk or pursuing game through the night, the X-Celsior transforms every hunt into a precise, thrilling adventure. The ATN X-Celsior provides the ultimate in nighttime hunting optics that delivers accuracy and reliability in any condition.", "manufacturerName": "ATN", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": false, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "3164e737-5b3a-4526-8d00-d80dd9165f13", "description": "ATN Corp, X-Celsior, Night/Day Rifle Scope, 5-15X Magnification, 15mm Objective, Multiple Reticle, 30mm Main Tube, Matte Finish, Black, Includes Battery Charger, Scope Rings, and Infrared Illuminator", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/ServiceImageUpload/6df9c524-a7a1-4235-81b7-3e1e0a450765/87014eef-a5f7-484e-9275-bd1677d49b10", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/4e501a31-9829-40b9-95c8-f7fe027c3896", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/79ea334e-eac0-4